<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Technical Data Sheet</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .header-subtitle { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: normal; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .section-heading { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 3px; }
        .data-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .data-label { font-weight: normal; }
        .data-value { font-weight: bold; }
        .logo { float: right; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div>
                <div class="header-title">Non-Metallic Systems</div>
                <div class="header-subtitle">Adaptalok 3-Way Coupler</div>
            </div>
            <div class="logo">
                <!-- Placeholder for logo -->
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 10pt;">
            <div>Technical Data Sheet</div>
            <div>201510</div>
            <div>Page 1</div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Technical Characteristics</div>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Conforms to</td>
                <td style="width: 70%;">
                    <span data-field="conformity_standard_1">{{ conformity_standard_1 }}</span><br>
                    <span data-field="conformity_standard_2">{{ conformity_standard_2 }}</span><br>
                    <span data-field="conformity_standard_3">{{ conformity_standard_3 }}</span><br>
                    <span data-field="conformity_standard_4">{{ conformity_standard_4 }}</span><br>
                    <span data-field="conformity_standard_5">{{ conformity_standard_5 }}</span>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="section-heading">Approvals and Standards</div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <!-- Placeholder for certification logos -->
            <span style="font-size: 20pt;">&#9888;</span> <!-- Placeholder for CE -->
            <span style="font-size: 20pt;">&#9888;</span> <!-- Placeholder for UL -->
            <span style="font-size: 20pt;">&#9888;</span> <!-- Placeholder for CSA -->
            <span style="font-size: 20pt;">&#9888;</span> <!-- Placeholder for NSF -->
        </div>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Degree of mechanical protection</td>
                <td style="width: 70%;">High Impact Resistance</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Degree of protection</td>
                <td>IP66 - As standard<br>IP67 - When fitted with ALS Seal<br>IP68 - When fitted with ALS Seal (1.1 Bar 35 mins)<br>IP69K - When fitted with ALS Seal</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">UV protection</td>
                <td style="width: 70%;">Very High</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Fitting Characteristics</td>
                <td>3-Way Coupler<br>Black (BL) as standard or Grey (GR) - RAL 7031</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Application</td>
                <td>For coupling three corrugated flexible conduits</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Normal operating temperature range</td>
                <td>Application: Min Temp <span data-field="min_temp">{{ min_temp }}</span>, <span data-field="max_temp">{{ max_temp }}</span><br>Dynamic - <span data-field="dynamic_min_temp">{{ dynamic_min_temp }}</span>, <span data-field="dynamic_max_temp">{{ dynamic_max_temp }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>For use with - Conduit Series</td>
                <td>Light, Standard and Heavyweight variants of type <span data-field="conduit_type_1">{{ conduit_type_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="conduit_type_2">{{ conduit_type_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="conduit_type_3">{{ conduit_type_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="conduit_type_4">{{ conduit_type_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="conduit_type_5">{{ conduit_type_5 }}</span> & <span data-field="conduit_type_6">{{ conduit_type_6 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Fire performance</td>
                <td>Test Standard: <span data-field="fire_standard">{{ fire_standard }}</span><br>Performance Rating: Approved<br>Self Extinguishing<br>NFF16-101: I4 F2<br>ISO 4589-2: 24% Low Smoke & Halogen Free<br>BS EN 60695-2-11: 850°C</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Testing data</td>
                <td>Click or See pages <span data-field="page_ref_1">{{ page_ref_1 }}</span> & <span data-field="page_ref_2">{{ page_ref_2 }}</span><br>UL94: V2</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Type of material</td>
                <td>Polyamide (Nylon) 66</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="section-heading">Image</div>
        <!-- Placeholder for image -->
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
            <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Product Image" style="max-width: 300px; height: auto;">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div>
                <div class="header-title">Dimensional Data</div>
            </div>
            <div style="float: right; font-size: 10pt;">Page 2</div>
        </div>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 10%;">Part No Black Body</th>
                    <th style="width: 10%;">Part No Grey Body</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">A</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">B</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">C</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">D</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">E</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">F</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">G</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">H</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">I</th>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">J</th>
                    <th style="width: 10%;">Nominal Dimensions (mm)</th>
                    <th style="width: 10%;">Nominal Conduit Size</th>
                    <th style="width: 10%;">Weight in grams (Each)</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for row in dimensional_data %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].part_no_black">{{ dimensional_data[loop.index0].part_no_black }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].part_no_grey">{{ dimensional_data[loop.index0].part_no_grey }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_a">{{ row.A }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_b">{{ row.B }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_c">{{ row.C }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_d">{{ row.D }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_e">{{ row.E }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_f">{{ row.F }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_g">{{ row.G }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_h">{{ row.H }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_i">{{ row.I }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_j">{{ row.J }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].nominal_dims">{{ dimensional_data[loop.index0].nominal_dims }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].nominal_conduit_size">{{ dimensional_data[loop.index0].nominal_conduit_size }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="dimensional_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].weight">{{ dimensional_data[loop.index0].weight }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <!-- Diagram Placeholder -->
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; margin-top: 50px;">
            <!-- Left Diagram -->
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <img src="diagram_left.png" alt="Dimensional Diagram Left" style="max-width: 300px;">
                <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">L</span><br>
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">H</span><br>
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">A</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Right Diagram -->
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <img src="diagram_right.png" alt="Dimensional Diagram Right" style="max-width: 300px;">
                <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">E</span><br>
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">Ø</span><br>
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">B</span><br>
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">J</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div>
                <div class="header-title">BS EN 61386 Classification</div>
            </div>
            <div style="float: right; font-size: 10pt;">Page 3</div>
        </div>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Fitting</th>
                    <th>AL</th>
                    <th>N/A</th>
                    <th>4</th>
                    <th>2</th>
                    <th>4</th>
                    <th>2</th>
                    <th>6</th>
                    <th>6</th>
                    <th>0</th>
                    <th>1</th>
                    <th>1</th>
                    <th>0</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <!-- Data rows for classification -->
                <tr>
                    <td><!-- Placeholder for fitting type --></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_al">{{ classification_al }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_na">{{ classification_na }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_4_1">{{ classification_4_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_2_1">{{ classification_2_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_4_2">{{ classification_4_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_2_2">{{ classification_2_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_6_1">{{ classification_6_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_6_2">{{ classification_6_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_0">{{ classification_0 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_1_1">{{ classification_1_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_1_2">{{ classification_1_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="classification_0_2">{{ classification_0_2 }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="section-heading">Mechanical Properties</div>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Test Type</th>
                    <th>Methods / Standards</th>
                    <th>Requirements</th>
                    <th>Value</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Tensile Strength</td>
                    <td>IEC61386-1</td>
                    <td>2 mins at Specified Value (PAFS21 Conduit)</td>
                    <td>Class 1</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Tensile Strength</td>
                    <td>IEC61386-1</td>
                    <td>Ultimate Pullout (PAFS21 Conduit)</td>
                    <td>240N</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Impact Strength @ -45°C</td>
                    <td>IEC61386-1</td>
                    <td>No visible damage</td>
                    <td>Class 1</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Impact Strength @ -5°C</td>
                    <td>IEC61386-1</td>
                    <td>No visible damage</td>
                    <td>Class 3</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Impact Strength @ 23°C</td>
                    <td>IEC61386-1</td>
                    <td>No visible damage</td>
                    <td>Class 5</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="section-heading">Thermal Properties</div>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Test Type</th>
                    <th>Methods / Standards</th>
                    <th>Requirements</th>
                    <th>Value</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Dynamic Applications</td>
                    <td>IEC 61386-23</td>
                    <td>5000 Operations at MBR 2hrs</td>
                    <td>-45°C to +120°C</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Static Short Term Temp</td>
                    <td></td>
                    <td>Temporary Use (3000hrs)</td>
                    <td>-50°C to +120°C</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Static Long Term Temp</td>
                    <td></td>
                    <td>Permanent Use (30,000 Hours)</td>
                    <td>-40°C to +105°C</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div>
                <div class="header-title">Flammability</div>
            </div>
            <div style="float: right; font-size: 10pt;">Page 4</div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Flammability</div>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Test Type</th>
                    <th>Method / Standard</th>
                    <th>Requirement</th>
                    <th>Result</th>
                    <th>Unit</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Glow Wire</td>
                    <td>BS EN 60695-2-11</td>
                    <td>Extinguish within 30s</td>
                    <td>850°C</td>
                    <td>°C</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Flammability</td>
                    <td>IEC 61386-1-12</td>
                    <td>1Kw Burner Flame to Self Extinguish</td>
                    <td>Pass</td>
                    <td>Pass/Fail</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Oxygen Index</td>
                    <td>ISO 4589-2</td>
                    <td></td>
                    <td>24.1</td>
                    <td>%</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Ignition Rating</td>
                    <td>NF F16-101</td>
                    <td>I Rating</td>
                    <td>I4</td>
                    <td>-</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="section-heading">Smoke</div>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Test Type</th>
                    <th>Method / Standard</th>
                    <th>Requirement</th>
                    <th>Result</th>
                    <th>Unit</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Fume Rating</td>
                    <td>NF F16-101</td>
                    <td>F Rating</td>
                    <td>F2</td>
                    <td>-</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="section-heading">Toxicity</div>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Test Type</th>
                    <th>Method / Standard</th>
                    <th>Requirement</th>
                    <th>Result</th>
                    <th>Unit</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Halogen Free</td>
                    <td>NFFX 70-100</td>
                    <td>&lt; 0.5%</td>
                    <td>Pass</td>
                    <td>Pass/Fail</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="section-heading">Pre Test Conditions</div>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Duration</th>
                    <th>Standard</th>
                    <th>Temperature</th>
                    <th>Relative Humidity</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>168 (Hours)</td>
                    <td>IEC61386</td>
                    <td>23 (°C)</td>
                    <td>50 (%)</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="section-heading">Chemical Resistance Chart</div>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Key:</th>
                    <th>Solvent</th>
                    <th>Resistant</th>
                    <th>Not Resistant</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <!-- Chemical resistance matrix -->
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="4">
                        <table style="width: 100%;">
                            <tr>
                                <th style="width: 20%;">Solvent</th>
                                {% for solvent in chemical_solvents %}
                                    <th style="width: 10%;">{{ solvent.name }}</th>
                                {% endfor %}
                                <th>Resistant</th>
                                <th>Not Resistant</th>
                            </tr>
                            {% for solvent in chemical_solvents %}
                            <tr>
                                <td style="font-weight: bold;">{{ solvent.name }}</td>
                                {% for other_solvent in chemical_solvents %}
                                    <td style="text-align: center;">
                                        {% if solvent.is_resistant_to(other_solvent) %}
                                            &#10003;
                                        {% else %}
                                            &#10007;
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </td>
                                {% endfor %}
                                <td style="text-align: center;">
                                    {% if solvent.is_resistant_to_all() %}
                                        &#10003;
                                    {% else %}
                                        &#10007;
                                    {% endif %}
                                </td>
                                <td style="text-align: center;">
                                    {% if solvent.is_not_resistant_to_any() %}
                                        &#10007;
                                    {% else %}
                                        &#10003;
                                    {% endif %}
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 9pt;">
            <p>The information above is given as a guide only and is based on published technical data and experience. The chemical and temperature data are indicative and may vary. The above chemicals present no health and safety risks. The end user should assess compatibility with their application and contact Thomas & Betts for further information.</p>
            <p>ADHERENCE TO THE CURRENT WIRING REGULATIONS B57671 OR NEC WIRING REGULATIONS (FOR USA) IS STRONGLY ADVISED.</p>
            <p>MINIMUM BEND RADIUS FOR FLEXING IS DEPENDANT UPON TEMPERATURE, BENDING FREQUENCY AND CHEMICAL ENVIRONMENT.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>